              "ev-bc459edd86d7-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 16,
              "start": 16
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court needed to decide how to interpret Rule\u202f60(b): whether it covers legal errors (mistakes of law) or only factual errors, and which subsection\u2014(b)(1) or (b)(6)\u2014applies."
      }
    ],
