          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioner (Dexter Earl Kemp), according to Petitioner (Dexter Earl Kemp), kemp maintained that Rule\u202f60(b)(6) governs his case because Rule\u202f60(b)(1) does not cover legal errors or judicial mistakes."
        },
