            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioner (Dexter Earl Kemp), according to Petitioner (Dexter Earl Kemp), kemp argued that the only other rules covering legal errors are (b)(4) for void judgments and (b)(5), which are narrow and mutually exclusive with (b)(6)."
        }
